From: mscharged-port
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve original live audio ownership on native ABI
Upstream-base: 132cdee912111da6c9973b1dce13651f1979b07d

Adapt live sound-handle notification/tree keys without widening any authored
hash, serialized field or script word. Use authoritative native owning fields
for slider/RPC views, retaining original console views. Original requests,
constructor/factory boundary, tree/ring traversal and algorithms are unchanged.
Whole AudioSystem supplies its real globals; this is not audio/AX readiness.
Depends on reviewed native registry/script/control transport0265/0271/0278.

